                <p>Source: Carter Library, Plains File, Subject File, Box 30, NSC/SCC Minutes,
                    3/1/80–4/15/80. Secret; Sensitive. The meeting took place in the White House
                    Situation Room.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d103-f2" n="2" xml:id="d103-f2-content">
                <p>The SCC discussed basing rights in Somalia on April 14. See <ref
                        target="frus1977-80v18#d73">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1977–1980, vol. XVIII,
                        Middle East Region; Arabian Peninsula, Document 73</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
